PLACEHOLDER: Replace this file with your logo.png

The Sidebar component expects a logo at: /public/logo.png

Instructions:
1. Save your logo as logo.png in the /public folder
2. Recommended size: 48x48px minimum (will scale to fit)
3. Formats supported: PNG, SVG, JPG, WEBP
4. The logo will appear in a 48x48px rounded square

Once you add your logo, delete this placeholder file.
